{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39697","headline":"旅怀寄友人 · 黄滔","name":"旅怀寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重叠愁肠只自知，苦於吞蘖乱於丝。\n一船风雨分襟处，千里烟波回首时。\n故国田园经战後，穷荒日月逼秋期。\n鸣蝉似会悠扬意，陌上声声怨柳衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}